 "notes": [
  "On 1h, the third green Heikin Ashi candle in a row gave 12,004 entries in 1,873 separate moves. Twenty candles later they were 0.06% ahead of random, just above a luck band that tops out at 0.03%. At 10, 50 and 100 candles they were the same as random. Split by trend, they were the same as random both above and below the 200-day average, so neither regime carries the pooled result.",
  "On 4h the same setting was 0.12% ahead of random, inside a band of -0.19% to 0.18%. On daily it was 0.38% ahead, inside -1.33% to 1.22%. Each pair alone had too few separate moves on daily to judge.",
  "The first red Heikin Ashi candle on 1h gives about one and three-quarter times as many entries as the third green one. Its entries bunch into 283 separate moves, against 1,873 for the green setting. A short after it beat random by 0.05% at 20 candles, and also beat random at 50 and 100 candles, though not at 10. It still beats random without its strongest stretch, 242 entries between Apr 27, 2022 and Jul 11, 2022, the sell-off that held the Terra collapse.",
  "Split by trend, the 1h short is fragile on both sides. Below the 200-day average it beat random by 0.06%, but that rests on the same stretch between Apr 27, 2022 and Jul 11, 2022. Above it, the gap rests on 76 entries between Sep 1, 2020 and Sep 23, 2020 and shows at 20 candles only. On single pairs, BTC and SOL are fragile and ETH was the same as random.",
  "On 4h the short beat random by 0.15%, just above the band, but the gap comes from 121 entries between Jul 29, 2022 and Jan 1, 2023, the stretch that held the FTX collapse. In uptrends it beat random by 0.24%, resting on entries between Oct 29, 2021 and Jan 19, 2022. In downtrends it was the same as random. On daily it had 22 separate moves, under the 30 needed to judge.",
  "For a long DCA bot, waiting for three green Heikin Ashi candles did no better than a random start on these pairs, so the DCA orders and take profit do the work. The first red candle on 1h is a small tilt: 0.05% over 20 candles is small next to a short bot's take profit. It fits as a filter beside other short conditions. It showed at 50 and 100 candles but not at 10, so a short bot with a quick take profit gets little from it."
 ],
